{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんばちは\n \n 前々回回の「日向坂で会いましょう」で\n 一番笑ったのは\n まおちゃんが目を掻いていた場面です。\n 11回くらい巻き戻して見ました。\n \n お腹がよじれるほど笑いました。\n \n 「日向坂で会いましょう」って面白いですね😚\n \n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n \n 少し前になってしまうのですが、\n 個別握手会で生誕祭をしていただきました！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33FB64FFTS8MGVXC1KY90Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33FC5Q6VJA3PZHEWG3V38R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n Tシャツにもたっくさんの意味が込められていて、\n 缶バッジもレーンの飾り付けも\n ぜーーーーーんぶ可愛くて、\n 愛を感じました😭\n \n 本当にありがとうございました！\n \n 少しだけ不安になる時もあるけど、\n こういう風に思ってくれる\n おひさまがいるっていうことが\n 私の支えであり、力の源です！！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33FD6GAKEYHRTTHKC8SFY2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33FE43FQDYVWH8FKB7P8E7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 嬉しすぎてハグ😚💗\n \n これからも、ずっと、\n よろしくお願いします！！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33FF6K9YBTQYBTVTY8YX2Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33FG6E307X97TSHG05MJD0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33FH9WMK3F7XJ6WB5X1B7Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33FJBP440897EC2W4BKS0H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33FKCTV3H8Q2YP14HD8XMY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33FMDRD57V5JQ9KBTDTR8Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n お花もこんなに沢山ありがとうございます🥺💘\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33FNGXCJ8NM956HK9VAZGP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n お花についてたメンバー全員の\n 名前入りのバルーン🎈\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33FPGCTB56FK45BZME9SAH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n ハッピーが沢山あふれた1日を\n ありがとうございました😊\n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}